    20	/**
    21	 * What a sheet held as of a date. Each time the sheet's today changes, its rows are copied into a
    22	 * schema of their own (SNAP_<id>, listed in sheet_snapshot). The sheet as of a date is what it held
    23	 * at the last moment its today was on or before that date: the store as it is now while its today
    24	 * still is, else the copy taken when its today last moved past that date, else nothing. A view
    25	 * copies that into a schema the request reads (ASOF_<n>), with the date as the sheet's today, and
    26	 * drops it after.
